  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is a&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></math> matrix such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, then trace of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is (where, the trace of the matrix is the sum of all principal diagonal elements of the matrix)"
